# Repo-root .dockerignore — keeps the build context small for images built
# with the repo root as context (currently: apps/web-next/Dockerfile).
# Service Dockerfiles under services/* are built with their own directory as
# context and are unaffected by this file.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
.local
.DS_Store
infra
docs
*.log
